Monthly fields of kPAR, i.e. the attenuation length scale of 
photosynthetically available radiation (PAR), based on k490 from 
SeaWiFS 1997-2001.

Rochford P.A., A.B. Kara, A.J. Wallcraft and R.A. Arnone, 2001:
Importance of solar subsurface heating in ocean general circulation 
models.  J. Geophys. Res., 106, 30923-30938.

Stored on the COADS grid in "NRL wind" file format, process with 
hycom/ALL/force/src/kp.  See seawifs_mon_kpar_EXAMPLE.com.

